---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactCta from '../../../components/ContactCta.astro';

const locale = 'en' as const;
---

<Layout
  locale={locale}
  title="Fractional CTO & SMB Governance | Monessor"
  description="IT maturity diagnostic, governance, and fractional CTO services for leaders of industrial and distribution SMBs ($10M–$100M CAD). Eliminate technical debt and integrate AI with rigor, free of conflicts of interest."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Executive Technology Leadership • Established SMBs ($10M – $100M)</p>
      <h1>Secure your technology investments and accelerate growth without the overhead of a full-time executive.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Monessor supports the leadership teams of industrial and distribution SMBs to eliminate technical debt,
        arbitrate critical projects, and integrate artificial intelligence with strict business rigor.
      </p>

      <div class="microproof">
        <div class="pill">100% Independent</div>
        <div class="pill">Zero Conflict of Interest</div>
        <div class="pill">Executive Format</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <ContactCta
          href="https://calendar.app.google/jrWp3LMihMCr5qew7"
          label="Schedule a meeting"
          ariaLabel="Schedule a meeting"
          className="btn"
          fathomEventName="Click ScheduleMeeting Service-SMB-Hero"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SYMPTOMS OF A GOVERNANCE DEFICIT -->
  <section class="section" id="symptoms">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Where technology stops being a lever and becomes a risk</h2>

      <div class="cards mt-6">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Runaway projects &amp; uncontrolled costs</h3>
          <p>
            IT budgets and infrastructure bills that climb every year with no clear visibility into return on
            investment (ROI), and repeated delays on strategic deliverables.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Technical debt &amp; critical dependency</h3>
          <p>
            Core systems (ERP, CRM, proprietary applications) that are complex, vulnerable, and maintained by a
            handful of key individuals or a single vendor (vendor lock-in).
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>AI paralysis &amp; media noise</h3>
          <p>
            Pressure to integrate artificial intelligence without a measurable business case, risking significant
            spend with no operational value created.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Friction between Finance and IT</h3>
          <p>
            A difficult dialogue between the CFO (focused on optimizing the P&amp;L and balance sheet) and technical
            teams consumed by daily firefighting.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ENTRY OFFER: IT MATURITY DIAGNOSTIC & AI ALIGNMENT -->
  <section class="section section--alt" id="diagnostic">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">01 / DIAGNOSTIC &amp; ALIGNMENT</p>
      <h2>IT Maturity Diagnostic &amp; AI Alignment</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        A 2- to 3-week strategic audit that gives the Executive Committee and Board full visibility into the state,
        risks, and potential of their technology estate.
      </p>
      <p class="lead" style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent);">
        Starting at $12,500 CAD <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400; color: var(--muted);">(Fixed-scope engagement)</span>
      </p>

      <div class="bullets">
        <div class="bullet">
          <p class="bullet-title">Architecture &amp; Technical Debt Audit</p>
          <p>
            Neutral inspection of core system stability, identification of operational failure risks, and
            evaluation of the true cost of ownership (TCO).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet">
          <p class="bullet-title">High-ROI AI Opportunity Matrix</p>
          <p>
            Assessment of short-term automatable business processes with calculated financial return (versus
            trend-driven projects).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet">
          <p class="bullet-title">Governance &amp; Vendor Contract Review</p>
          <p>
            Independent challenge of vendor quotes, Cloud cost analysis, and renegotiation of vendor dependencies.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bullet">
          <p class="bullet-title">Executive Roadmap (18 months)</p>
          <p>
            A clear, prioritized, and costed plan of action, ready to present to the Board of Directors.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <ContactCta
          href="https://calendar.app.google/jrWp3LMihMCr5qew7"
          label="Schedule a meeting"
          ariaLabel="Schedule a meeting"
          className="btn"
          fathomEventName="Click ScheduleMeeting Service-SMB-Diagnostic"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ONGOING ENGAGEMENT MODEL -->
  <section class="section" id="approach">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Our phased approach: From assessment to execution</h2>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <p class="step-num">01</p>
          <h3>IT Maturity Diagnostic</h3>
          <p class="small">2 to 3 weeks | From $12,500</p>
          <p>Clarify the technology situation, audit debt, and establish the strategic roadmap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <p class="step-num">02</p>
          <h3>Vendor Selection &amp; Arbitration</h3>
          <p class="small">4 to 8 weeks | From $15,000</p>
          <p>
            Drafting neutral RFPs, managing tender processes, objective vendor selection, and conflict-free
            contract negotiation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <p class="step-num">03</p>
          <h3>Fractional CTO / Part-Time IT Leadership</h3>
          <p class="small">Monthly | From $8,000/month</p>
          <p>
            Embedding senior technology leadership within the executive team (1 to 2 days/week) to drive execution,
            oversee teams, and reassure the Board of Directors.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CROSS-LINK -->
  <section class="section" id="regulated-sectors">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="card" style="max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Operating in a regulated financial sector (FinTech, Insurance)?
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/en/services/regulated-fs-governance/">Explore our Governance &amp; OSFI Compliance offer →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STRICT NEUTRALITY COMMITMENT -->
  <section class="section section--alt" id="neutrality">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Strict Neutrality Commitment</p>
      <h2>Zero commission. Zero software resale. 100% on your side of the table.</h2>

      <div class="note">
        <p>
          « What Monessor is not: a custom development agency, a software reseller (SaaS/ERP), or an engineering
          subcontractor. We accept no referral commissions from vendors. Our sole financial incentive is your
          company's success and the protection of its interests. »
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
